{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"valid\": true,\n  \"why\": \"解释成立。H2已建立他真实享受亲近，并因这份快乐珍贵而越来越舍不得它结束；H3又建立了他对这份亲近的留恋和沉浸。因此，先前的满足加深珍惜，珍惜又使欢喜中生出急切，有明确的心理因果，并非只宣布情绪结果。S04-B1中熟悉的亲密声线再次出现，却比先前更迫切；S04-B4中亲近仍然美好，却已经生出舍不得的酸楚，都支持这一解释。它说明了为何原本的快乐会带上急切，不依赖未建立的人物前史，也没有把听感比喻当作真实事件。\",\n  \"coverage_gaps\": [\n    \"S04-B1：尚未解释为何表达变得格外华丽、密集，像一句话说完仍忍不住折回补充更多细节。\",\n    \"S04-B2：尚未解释高处长颤音中情意炽烈打开却又颤抖、退弱、无法稳稳落下，以及第34小节逐渐安静的变化。\",\n    \"S04-B3：尚未解释不自觉握紧的动作感，以及越想抓牢当下、越感到平衡脆弱的矛盾。\",\n    \"S04-B4：已部分解释甜蜜中的舍不得，但尚未充分解释亲近仍在持续、时间却仿佛不断倒数的流逝感。\"\n  ]\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "7f18d6a3-2122-4943-bd0b-0e0fc06a292a", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261025T045541821744Z", "elapsed_seconds": 24.657, "completed_utc": "2026-10-25T04:56:06.478189+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "803a5a37bf2bbfdb6fbcdc45414362de31e04e34f95111b06ba51dfb284c152c", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "5968886fe255f06b948842c8a649fd0127f8ddec9fc4958701d80251c394b449", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f